00:00:00.980 --> 00:00:02.180
I object.

2
00:00:02.180 --> 00:00:03.180
What?

3
00:00:03.180 --> 00:00:04.180
Oh my God.

4
00:00:04.180 --> 00:00:06.180
You love her so much.

5
00:00:06.180 --> 00:00:10.650
What does that mean?

6
00:00:10.650 --> 00:00:12.150
It isn't!

7
00:00:12.150 --> 00:00:13.650
I told you today is a big day.

8
00:00:13.650 --> 00:00:15.150
Don't go crazy here!

9
00:00:15.150 --> 00:00:23.240
