10
00:00:23.240 --> 00:00:26.040
Her name is not Evelyn Voss.

11
00:00:26.040 --> 00:00:27.640
She's a liar!

12
00:00:27.640 --> 00:00:29.640
An imposter!

13
00:00:29.640 --> 00:00:31.540
Sophia!

14
00:00:31.540 --> 00:00:34.140
What are you doing here?

15
00:00:34.140 --> 00:00:36.840
Arthur, I'm here to help you.

16
00:00:37.040 --> 00:00:40.840
This woman, her real name is Evelyn White.

17
00:00:40.840 --> 00:00:42.240
She's an orphan.

18
00:00:42.240 --> 00:00:47.600
