19
00:00:47.600 --> 00:00:52.510
Sophia, have you finished?

20
00:00:52.510 --> 00:00:53.910
She's right.

21
00:00:53.910 --> 00:00:56.010
My name is not Evelyn Voss.

22
00:00:56.010 --> 00:00:58.010
I'm Evelyn White.

23
00:00:58.010 --> 00:01:05.980
Evelyn.

24
00:01:05.980 --> 00:01:08.480
But she's wrong.

25
00:01:08.480 --> 00:01:17.300
I didn't approach you for money.

26
00:01:17.300 --> 00:01:19.900
I'm here to expose the truth

27
00:01:19.900 --> 00:01:23.000
about how you killed your wife, Isadella Hart,

28
00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:24.500
10 years ago!
